<title>BELGIUM: EU grain trade holds annual meeting.</title>
<headline>EU grain trade holds annual meeting.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>European Union grain traders converged on Brussels on Thursday for the annual meeting of Coceral, the EU grain trade lobby, trade sources said.</p>
<p>Coceral officials could not be reached for comment on the closed-door meeting.</p>
<p>&quot;It's an internal affair,&quot; said one trade source.</p>
<p>But some members are expected to press for improvements after the London-based Grain and Feed Trade Association (GAFTA) called in January for more effective mechanisms for lobbying EU institutions.</p>
<p>--Brussels Bureau +322 287 6830</p>
</text>
